  "_note": "Quest definitions. Each player gets a deterministic pick of 3 daily quests (seeded by user and UTC date) and a chain of 5 weekly quests (seeded by user and ISO week), preferring distinct verbs. verb is a server event: shift_complete, perp_open, perp_close, prediction_place, alpha_call, paid_call (a funded call the payee accepted, counted for both sides), tip_send (Cash tip of at least 100 cents), home_visit (someone else's home). Progress comes only from server events, never from the client. reward.cashCents pays as ledger reason quest_reward; reward.seasonXp is recorded in season_xp. deepLink is the screen the client opens. The FE may reword titles; ids are stable. To add a quest, add it here: no code change.",
